  "interpretation": [
    "The finer solar basis reduced the 8504 s000009 reflected-solar excess but did not eliminate its unchanged error-band failure.",
    "MF4 worsened 8504 s000011 from within the band to outside it; a finer basis did not give consistent improvement.",
    "The remaining failed values have zero finite direct contribution in both candidate and reference. This localizes their discrepancy to diffuse/ground and reflected solar, without proving a unique estimator or basis cause.",
    "Each of the twelve A reference cases meets its own repeat/block checks. Complete A/B reference coverage and both declared sensitivity families remain separate requirements.",
